# PFE improvement history

After finishing a real feature, bugfix, or diagnostic improvement, **write the history entry in the same turn**. Do not wait for the user to ask. Do not skip it because the chat already explained the change.

Do **not** document trivial edits (typos, formatting-only, comment-only).

## Where

- New file: `docs/history/YYYY-MM-DD-short-title.md` (today's date from user_info)
- Update the index table in `docs/history/README.md` (newest first)
- Match the structure of existing entries (see `docs/history/2026-08-19-evidence-aware-ai-prompts.md`)

## Required sections

Context, Problem, Design, Implementation (files), Tests, Result or example, Out of scope, Verify commands, Rapport talking points.

Metadata table at the top: Date, Module, Type, Status.

Write for later copy-paste into the PFE rapport: concrete, technical, no filler.

## Example index row

```markdown
| 2026-08-19 | Evidence-aware AI prompt templates | FastAPI / Ollama | [2026-08-19-evidence-aware-ai-prompts.md](./2026-08-19-evidence-aware-ai-prompts.md) |
```
